  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "description": "Clean-room, robots-aware web information gathering: multi-engine search, HTML/PDF/Office/feed extraction, Bilibili/Zhihu/Xiaohongshu reading, sitemaps and resumable surfing, plus a browser mode with seven read-only playbooks. CLI + two MCP servers."
